{"id":"4149a72ef2e073f9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-zero-error-query-complexity.md","title":"Zero-Error Randomized Query Complexity","display":"df-zero-error-query-complexity — Zero-Error Randomized Query Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-zero-error-query-complexity","aliases":["28-df-zero-error-query-complexity"],"display":"df-zero-error-query-complexity — Zero-Error Randomized Query Complexity","depends_on":["[[28-df-decision-tree]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.6","source_printed_pages":"264","source_pdf_pages":"290","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-zero-error-query-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-zero-error-query-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-error-query-complexity — Zero-Error Randomized Query Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"264"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"290"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_f,\\operatorname{cost}\">\\(\\mathcal T_f,\\operatorname{cost}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4526464ba7e934ba\" href=\"?note=4526464ba7e934ba\" title=\"28-df-decision-tree\">28-df-decision-tree</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_f\">\\(\\Delta_f\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_f\">\\(\\mathcal T_f\\)</span> 上所有有限支撑概率分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\mu)=\\{t:\\mu(t)&gt;0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(\\mu)=\\{t:\\mu(t)&gt;0\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_f\\coloneqq\\{\\mu:\\mathcal T_f\\to[0,1]:|\\operatorname{supp}(\\mu)|&lt;\\infty,\\ \\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\mu(t)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_f\\coloneqq\\{\\mu:\\mathcal T_f\\to[0,1]:|\\operatorname{supp}(\\mu)|&lt;\\infty,\\ \\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\mu(t)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_0(f)\\coloneqq\\inf_{\\mu\\in\\Delta_f}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\mu(t)\\operatorname{cost}(t,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_0(f)\\coloneqq\\inf_{\\mu\\in\\Delta_f}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\mu(t)\\operatorname{cost}(t,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分布仅支持处处正确的树，因而零错误是逐输入、逐树的要求。删去重复查询后有限输入规模只需有限多棵深度至多n的树；优化可化为有限单纯形的连续最小化，因此下确界实际达到。记R_0以区别有错误的随机通信复杂度。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.6；印刷页 264；PDF 页 290。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Zero-Error Randomized Query Complexity，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-decision-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"4526464ba7e934ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathcal T_f,\\operatorname{cost}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_f,\\operatorname{cost}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(\\mu)=\\{t:\\mu(t)>0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_f\\coloneqq\\{\\mu:\\mathcal T_f\\to[0,1]:|\\operatorname{supp}(\\mu)|<\\infty,\\ \\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\mu(t)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R_0(f)\\coloneqq\\inf_{\\mu\\in\\Delta_f}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\sum_{t\\in\\mathcal T_f}\\mu(t)\\operatorname{cost}(t,x).","display":true}],"bytes":1819,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"}],"outgoing":["4526464ba7e934ba"]}